    "messages": [
        {
            "id": "a003_382_0000",
            "en_US": [
                "I come shop at the Shopping Mall a lot\n",
                "because I want all the TMs!"
            ]
        },
        {
            "id": "a003_382_0001",
            "en_US": [
                "On the first floor, they sell medicines.{VAR BE01}\n",
                "On the second floor, they sell TMs\n",
                "and different kinds of Mail.{VAR BE01}\n",
                "On the third floor, they sell items for\n",
                "raising stats and battle items.{VAR BE01}\n",
                "I really admire Mr. Clyde, the\n",
                "Pokémon Gym guide, so I'm practicing{VAR BE00}\n",
                "being a guide, too!"
            ]
        },
        {
            "id": "a003_382_0002",
            "en_US": [
                "There are even some people in the mall\n",
                "who will challenge you to battles."
            ]
        },
        {
            "id": "a003_382_0003",
            "en_US": [
                "The thing I buy most often is the item\n",
                "that raises a Pokémon's HP, called HP Up.{VAR BE01}\n",
                "There are also a lot of other items that\n",
                "catch my eye."
            ]
        },
