        {
            "id": "a003_382_0013",
            "en_US": [
                "Good Trainers never use only\n",
                "brute force.{VAR BE01}\n",
                "They think about many different\n",
                "strategies, such as which Pokémon and{VAR BE00}\n",
                "moves to use in battle, or the best time{VAR BE00}\n",
                "to use an item."
            ]
        },
        {
            "id": "a003_382_0014",
            "en_US": "Playing hide-and-seek would be fun!"
        },
        {
            "id": "a003_382_0015",
            "en_US": [
                "Welcome to Shopping Mall Nine!\n",
                "It's called Nine because it's on Route 9.{VAR BE01}\n",
                "You can remember it by thinking of this:\n",
                "“Done shopping? Nein!\""
            ]
        },
        {
            "id": "a003_382_0016",
            "en_US": [
                "Have you heard? There's a cave\n",
                "along Route 9.{VAR BE01}\n",
                "I don't know exactly where it is or\n",
                "what's in it, though."
            ]
        },
        {
            "id": "a003_382_0017",
            "en_US": [
                "Hey! Pokémon Trainer!{VAR BE01}\n",
                "Do you know about an item called\n",
                "the Thunderstone?"
            ]
        },
        {
            "id": "a003_382_0018",
            "en_US": [
                "So you know Thunderstones make certain\n",
                "Pokémon evolve, then? Niiice!{VAR BE01}"
            ]
        },
        {
            "id": "a003_382_0019",
            "en_US": [
                "Well then, I'll tell you!{VAR BE01}\n",
                "If you use the Thunderstone, it makes\n",
                "certain Pokémon evolve!{VAR BE01}"
            ]
        },
        {
            "id": "a003_382_0020",
            "en_US": [
                "Meeting here must be fate!\n",
                "This is for you!{VAR BE01}"
            ]
        },
        {
            "id": "a003_382_0021",
            "en_US": [
                "I've heard a Pokémon called Eelektrik\n",
                "evolves with the Thunderstone."
            ]
        },
        {
            "id": "a003_382_0022",
            "en_US": [
                "Shopping Mall Nine\n",
                "Colorful and wonderful!"
            ]
        }
    ]
